---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../../lib/site';
import WatchButtonGuide from '../../components/WatchButtonGuide.astro';
import { consumerProjects } from '../../data/projects';
---
<BaseLayout title="Pebble apps" description="What you need for XOCE’s Pebble apps: Time 2 or Round 2, the official phone app, and optional plugin connections.">
<main id="main" class="wrap launch-catalogue pebble-overview"><header class="catalogue-intro"><p class="eyebrow">PebbleOS</p><h1>For your Pebble.</h1><p>Two watchfaces, three watch apps and a Czech weather source. Use the pieces that help you.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/projects/')}>Explore the collection</a></header>
<section class="pebble-section" aria-labelledby="requirements-title"><h2 id="requirements-title">Before you install</h2><dl class="pebble-requirements"><div><dt>Your watch</dt><dd>The native apps target Pebble Time 2 and Round 2. Other Pebble models, including Duo, are not included.</dd></div><div><dt>Your phone</dt><dd>Pair through the <a href="https://repebble.com/app">official Pebble phone app</a>. Shared readings and activities use its Plugins / permissions preview. Music and notification integration needs Android.</dd></div><div><dt>Your apps</dt><dd>Check each product page’s release status first. Verified installation choices appear there when available. ČHMÚ Weather is a phone plugin with no watch screen.</dd></div></dl><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/pebble/setup/')}>Installation and setup steps</a></section>
<section class="pebble-section" aria-labelledby="first-steps-title"><h2 id="first-steps-title">Start small. Add what helps.</h2><ol class="setup-stages"><li><span class="eyebrow">01 / On the watch</span><h3>Try one timer.</h3><p>Start, pause and reuse a countdown. Its scheduled alarm runs on the watch.</p><a href={sitePath('/docs/pebble/setup/#timer')}>Set up Timer</a></li><li><span class="eyebrow">02 / On your clock</span><h3>Keep it in view.</h3><p>Add Dynamic or Halftone, configure sharing, then start a longer countdown.</p><a href={sitePath('/docs/pebble/activities/#try-a-timer-on-your-watchface')}>Connect a watchface</a></li><li><span class="eyebrow">03 / Your choice</span><h3>Add useful extras.</h3><p>Choose a shortcut, an overview or a Czech weather source when you need one.</p><a href={sitePath('/docs/#choose-what-you-need')}>Choose another piece</a></li></ol></section>
<section class="pebble-section" aria-labelledby="choose-title"><h2 id="choose-title">Choose what you need</h2><div class="pebble-choices">{consumerProjects.map(p=><a href={sitePath(`/projects/${p.slug}/`)}><strong>{p.name}</strong><span>{p.description}</span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="pebble-section pebble-button-section" id="watch-buttons" aria-labelledby="watch-buttons-title"><div><h2 id="watch-buttons-title">Four buttons. A few useful habits.</h2><p>Up and Down move through a list; Select opens the selected item. Back returns to the previous screen. Quick Launch assigns an app to a button shortcut.</p><p>The diagram shows Time 2. Round 2 uses the same button names.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/pebble/controls/')}>See each app’s controls</a></div><WatchButtonGuide/></section>
<section class="pebble-section" id="readings-and-activities"><h2>Small readings. Ongoing updates.</h2><dl class="pebble-requirements"><div><dt>A reading</dt><dd>A small piece of information, such as temperature or phone battery. Pebble calls these Complications. Choose the watchfaces’ readings in Pebble’s Complications settings.</dd></div><div><dt>An activity</dt><dd>An ongoing update, such as a Timer countdown displayed on Dynamic or Halftone after you leave Timer. The original app still handles the countdown and alarm. <a href={sitePath('/docs/pebble/activities/')}>Try it with Timer</a>.</dd></div><div><dt>A plugin</dt><dd>Code inside the official phone app that supplies information or actions. Some plugins are built in; others, like ČHMÚ Weather, are installed separately. There is no separate XOCE app or Activities library to install.</dd></div></dl></section>
<section class="pebble-section" aria-labelledby="weather-choice-title"><h2 id="weather-choice-title">Connect the pieces you choose.</h2><p>Timer keeps the countdown and alarm on the watch. With a connected phone, Dynamic, Halftone or Dashboard can show its activity. Open Activity adds Quick Launch shortcuts from your chosen watchface.</p><p>ČHMÚ Weather is an optional Czech weather source for Pebble Weather and compatible readings. Both watchfaces work with other compatible weather sources too.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/#a-useful-first-setup')}>Try Timer with a watchface</a></section>
</main></BaseLayout>
<style>
.pebble-section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px 0}.pebble-section>p{max-width:70ch;color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px}.pebble-section>.text-link{margin-top:22px}.pebble-requirements{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px;margin:25px 0}.pebble-requirements dt{font-weight:600}.pebble-requirements dd{margin:10px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.8}.pebble-choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:26px}.pebble-choices a{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:20px}.pebble-choices a span{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}.pebble-button-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}.pebble-button-section p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px}.pebble-button-section .text-link{margin-top:20px}@media(max-width:700px){.pebble-requirements,.pebble-button-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.pebble-choices{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.pebble-section h2{font-size:1.8rem}}
.setup-stages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:28px;list-style:none;margin:26px 0 0;padding:0}.setup-stages li{padding-left:18px;border-left:2px solid var(--accent)}.setup-stages h3{font-size:1.25rem;margin:10px 0}.setup-stages p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:14px}.setup-stages a{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--accent-text)}@media(max-width:700px){.setup-stages{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}}
</style>
